Package: RHbreak
Title: Piecewise Regression and De-Seasonalization Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
  person("Tangmj", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "3232036033@qq.com"))
Description: Minimal tools for time series preprocessing and change point
    analysis: removing the seasonal cycle by calendar day, and fitting
    piecewise linear regressions with one or multiple breakpoints sharing
    a common slope.
